tle><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Learn how Vaelo protects your data and complies with the DPDP Act.\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.webmanifest\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Vaelo | Institutional-grade financial analysis\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Institutional-grade financial analysis for independent CA practices\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://vaelo.co.in\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Vaelo\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_IN\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"http://localhost:3000/opengraph-image?a67fca71f9856096\"/><meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Vaelo - Institutional-grade financial analysis\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Vaelo | Institutional-grade financial analysis\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Institutional-grade financial analysis for independent CA practices\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"http://localhost:3000/opengraph-image?a67fca71f9856096\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"Vaelo - Institutional-grade financial analysis\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg?icon.3iysonzhh3pit.svg\" sizes=\"any\" type=\"image/svg+xml\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon?a0d61ffc213ad2ca\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"180x180\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><noscript><style>\n            /* Fallback for users with JS disabled: override framer-motion initial opacity: 0 */\n            div, span, p, h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6, section, article {\n              opacity: 1 !important;\n              transform: none !important;\n            }\n          </style></noscript><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-full flex flex-col font-sans bg-paper text-ink\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><nav class=\"border-b border-ledger-line bg-paper sticky top-0 z-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex justify-between h-16 items-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center\"><a class=\"flex items-center hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-200\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Vaelo\" width=\"120\" height=\"36\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/branding/vaelo-logo-lockup.svg\"/></a></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center space-x-8\"><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/how-it-works\">How it works</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><div class=\"hidden md:block\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 border border-transparent text-sm font-medium rounded-sm text-paper bg-corporate-blue hover:bg-corporate-blue/90 hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-sm transition-all duration-200\" href=\"/contact\">Get Started</a></div><div class=\"flex md:hidden items-center\"><button class=\"text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue focus:outline-none p-2\" aria-label=\"Toggle mobile menu\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></nav><div class=\"flex-grow\"><div style=\"opacity:0\"><main><section class=\"bg-white py-20 border-b border-ledger-line\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-12 border-b border-ledger-line pb-8\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-serif text-ink tracking-tight mb-4\">Privacy Policy</h1><p class=\"text-slate text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-wider\">Effective Date: <!-- -->18 August 2026</p></div><div class=\"prose prose-slate prose-headings:font-serif prose-headings:text-ink prose-headings:font-medium prose-p:text-slate prose-a:text-corporate-blue max-w-none space-y-8\"><div><p class=\"text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6\">Vaelo (&quot;we&quot;, &quot;our&quot;, or &quot;us&quot;) provides institutional-grade financial analysis tools exclusively for Chartered Accountants (CAs) and financial professionals. Because you entrust us with sensitive client financial data, our privacy principles are simple: <strong>we collect only what is necessary to generate your reports, we protect it rigorously, and we never use your clients&#x27; data to train public AI models.</strong></p><p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information, and how we comply with the Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act of India.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl mt-10 mb-4\">1. What Data We Collect</h2><p>To provide our services, we collect the following types of information:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-4\"><li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Your name, firm name, email address, and billing details.</li><li><strong>WhatsApp Contact Information:</strong> The verified phone number you provide to receive your generated reports via the WhatsApp Business API.</li><li><strong>Client Financial Data:</strong> The raw financial data you submit for analysis. This includes Tally or Zoho exports, manual Profit &amp; Loss statements, Balance Sheets, and specific transaction assumptions needed to generate Valuation or Deal Feasibility reports.</li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl mt-10 mb-4\">2. How We Use Your Data</h2><p>Your data is used strictly to deliver the service you requested. We use the information to:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-4\"><li>Ingest and structure financial data to generate deterministic financial models (e.g., DCF valuations).</li><li>Deliver the final, white-labeled PDF reports to you via WhatsApp or email.</li><li>Provide customer support and respond to your inquiries.</li></ul><p class=\"mt-4 font-medium text-ink bg-paper p-4 border border-ledger-line rounded-sm\">We do not sell your data. We do not share your clients&#x27; financial data with unauthorized third parties. We strictly do not use your proprietary financial submissions to train external, shared, or public AI models.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl mt-10 mb-4\">3. Data Storage, Security &amp; Hosting</h2><p>We implement robust security measures to protect your data against unauthorized access or disclosure:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-4\"><li><strong>Encryption:</strong> All data is encrypted at rest and in transit using industry-standard protocols (TLS/SSL).</li><li><strong>Isolation:</strong> Client data is logically isolated between individual CA accounts. You cannot access another practice&#x27;s data, and they cannot access yours.</li><li><strong>Data Residency:</strong> Our primary databases and hosting infrastructure are located in secure, India-based data centers to comply with local data sovereignty preferences.</li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl mt-10 mb-4\">4. Third-Party Services</h2><p>We utilize select, trusted third-party infrastructure providers to deliver our service. These providers are bound by strict data processing agreements:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-4\"><li><strong>Meta (WhatsApp Business API):</strong> Used exclusively to deliver your completed reports and critical notifications securely to your registered WhatsApp number.</li><li><strong>Supabase &amp; Deno Deploy:</strong> Used for secure database hosting, authentication, application logic (Edge Functions), and encrypted file storage of your generated PDF reports.</li><li><strong>Payment Processors:</strong> We use secure, compliant payment gateways (e.g., Razorpay/Stripe) to process invoice payments. We do not store your credit card numbers on our servers.</li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl mt-10 mb-4\">5. Data Retention &amp; Deletion</h2><p>We retain your account information and generated reports for as long as your account is active, allowing you to access historical valuations.</p><p class=\"mt-2\">If you delete a client profile or close your Vaelo account, the associated raw financial data and generated reports are permanently deleted from our active databases within 30 days. You may request immediate deletion of specific client data at any time after a report is finalized.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl mt-10 mb-4\">6. Your Rights Under the DPDP Act</h2><p>In compliance with the Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act of India, you (and by extension, your clients) hold the following rights regarding personal data:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-4\"><li><strong>Right to Access:</strong> You can request a summary of the personal data we hold about you.</li><li><strong>Right to Correction:</strong> You can request that we correct any inaccurate or incomplete data.</li><li><strong>Right to Erasure:</strong> You can request the deletion of your personal data when it is no longer necessary for the purpose it was collected.</li><li><strong>Right to Grievance Redressal:</strong> You have the right to register a complaint regarding data processing.</li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl mt-10 mb-4\">7. Updates to This Policy</h2><p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in our practices or regulatory requirements. We will notify you of any material changes by sending an alert to your registered WhatsApp number or email address, or by placing a prominent notice on our website prior to the change becoming effective.</p></div><div class=\"pt-8 mt-12 border-t border-ledger-line\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl mb-4\">8. Contact Information</h2><p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, your data rights, or our security practices, please contact our Data Protection/Privacy Officer at:</p><p class=\"mt-4 font-mono font-medium text-corporate-blue\">vaelo.team@gmail.com</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">(We will update this to privacy@vaelo.co.in once the custom domain email is fully provisioned.)</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-corporate-blue text-paper py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif mb-6\">Ready to elevate your advisory practice?</h2><p class=\"text-blue-100 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Request a sample report today to see the rigor of our analysis firsthand. First-time practices can commission their first client report at a discounted pilot rate.</p><a class=\"inline-flex justify-center items-center px-8 py-4 border border-transparent text-base font-medium rounded-sm text-corporate-blue bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200\" href=\"/contact\">Request a sample report</a><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm font-mono text-blue-200\">No subscription required. Pay per report.</p></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div></div><footer class=\"bg-ink text-paper border-t border-ledger-line/20 py-12\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"col-span-1 md:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"bg-paper p-1.5 rounded-sm shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:scale-105\"><img alt=\"Vaelo Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"w-7 h-7\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/branding/vaelo-icon.svg\"/></div><span class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-paper transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-90\">Vaelo</span></a><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-xs leading-relaxed\">Institutional-grade financial analysis, purpose-built for independent Chartered Accountants in India.</p></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-4 font-mono\">Platform</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/how-it-works\">How It Works</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/pricing\">Pricing</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-4 font-mono\">Legal</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/terms\">Terms of Service</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-700/50 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 font-mono\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Vaelo. All rights reserved.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 mt-4 md:mt-0 font-mono\">Encrypted &amp; DPDP Act Conscious</p></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3s6nzrbk-8mnv.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n3:I[84834,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"Nav\\\"]\\n4:I[7562,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"PageTransition\\\"]\\n5:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n8:I[63935,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"RevealGroup\\\"]\\n9:I[63935,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"RevealItem\\\"]\\na:I[85437,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"Image\\\"]\\n12:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qmmyx4fljb30.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2l26vd-in2vdj.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/4194vy8pwc8fi.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/115e7a2565b70400-s.p.1vgtwd90zpq_8.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/70bc3e132a0a741e-s.p.3t6q91iet4nsy.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/83afe278b6a6bb3c-s.p.2bn3s6zvc0dyp.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n2:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"style\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"\\\\n            /* Fallba