ive, allowing you to access historical valuations.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"If you delete a client profile or close your Vaelo account, the associated raw financial data and generated reports are permanently deleted from our active databases within 30 days. You may request immediate deletion of specific client data at any time after a report is finalized.\"}]]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mt-10 mb-4\",\"children\":\"6. Your Rights Under the DPDP Act\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"In compliance with the Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act of India, you (and by extension, your clients) hold the following rights regarding personal data:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Right to Access:\"}],\" You can request a summary of the personal data we hold about you.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Right to Correction:\"}],\" You can request that we correct any inaccurate or incomplete data.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Right to Erasure:\"}],\" You can request the deletion of your personal data when it is no longer necessary for the purpose it was collected.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Right to Grievance Redressal:\"}],\" You have the right to register a complaint regarding data processing.\"]}]]}]]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mt-10 mb-4\",\"children\":\"7. Updates to This Policy\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in our practices or regulatory requirements. We will notify you of any material changes by sending an alert to your registered WhatsApp number or email address, or by plac